            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.96</h2>
<p style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 8px">This update is built on the first feedback from our users. Thank you, Filmpool!</p>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Favorites across the whole project</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>All favorites in one view.</b> Open “Favorites” below a project in the sidebar, or choose “Favorites in the whole project” in the filter menu. Each card shows its folder, and you can drag it straight into the composer.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Clear reasons</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 8px;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Know why a job cannot start.</b> If a file or a setting is rejected before a job starts, the app now says why and what to do, for example when a reference file is too large. Nothing is charged.</li>
<li><b>Large reference videos.</b> Previs and reference videos over 50 MB now upload reliably.</li>
<li><b>MOV for the FLUX upscaler.</b> MOV files in H.264 or HEVC are repackaged automatically. Other formats get a clear explanation.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Also</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Full length for video upscales.</b> Videos longer than 15 seconds are upscaled in full again.</li>
<li><b>Smoother gallery.</b> Short lists, such as your favorites, scroll back up reliably. The favorites filter now lives in the filter menu.</li>
<li><b>Feedback on Discord.</b> Report bugs and suggest features from the account menu.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
